&lt;div data-page-id=&quot;AiPQdXfdFoecDex1OG7lJgYoghb&quot; data-lark-html-role=&quot;root&quot; data-docx-has-block-data=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;list-bullet1&quot;&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OkNEdE9JRo10VvxhfUDlHOKsg0e&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Build core capabilities of the R&amp;amp;D Efficiency Platform and onboard business systems to improve overall engineering efficiency and delivery quality;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XXuidvBPhoVITlxrhzNl1OGOgpZ&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Design and optimize CI/CD pipelines (GitLab, Pipeline, ArgoCD), driving standardization, automation, and observability;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TeVBdPv5QonmYBxMY3elFgTVgGf&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Drive the &lt;strong&gt;AI-Native evolution of &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CI/CD&lt;/strong&gt;, introducing AI Agent / LLM for intelligent code review, pipeline self-healing, smart test orchestration, and change-risk prediction;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KHVPdR9eFomJF9xYv33lCCaIgmF&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Build &lt;strong&gt;DevSecOps capabilities&lt;/strong&gt;, embedding Shift-Left Security across the lifecycle with SAST, DAST, SCA, image/secret scanning, and security gates to ensure supply-chain security;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RpoRdCLnVo3WggxJ0ixlnm1TgPd&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Establish standardized &lt;strong&gt;Change Management&lt;/strong&gt;, covering requests, risk assessment, approvals (CAB), canary releases, rollback, and change traceability;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OODadnIFbog5CtxwW6tlJBK2gwf&quot; data-list=&quot;bullet&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Apply Kubernetes, microservice governance (Nacos, Apollo, Kong), and Aliyun / AWS cloud services to ensure platform stability and scalability.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
