&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;5123&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Strong computer science fundamentals and proven software engineering architecture experience.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
