&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;5220&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Ability to work independently in a fully remote, globally distributed team, and under pressure in a fast-paced environment.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
