&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;5708&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Proficiency in Go, or willingness to ramp up quickly — Go is Alpaca&#39;s primary backend language.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
