&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;5807&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Experience in the Japanese financial services sector (securities firms, banks, brokerages, or fintech).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
